recommend keep-going the dead-zone family opens cleanly; the next Lotus lap carries the rest of it (ALES88 soft_center_clip, ALES89 infinite_clip) into stereo — a mechanical kg continuation on the seated lift pattern. No gate reached; witness GREEN, TAME bans clean.
